WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.802 --> 00:00:07.121
"I'll let you run for a few minutes," Jackie said to Howler as he stared

2
00:00:07.122 --> 00:00:11.466
at her through the kennel gate. "But today is a work day, little buddy. No

3
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:18.688
time for play." It was the following Saturday. Jackie was glad to be back at

4
00:00:18.689 --> 00:00:23.115
the farm, but she was also worried. She'd gone to a football game last night

5
00:00:23.116 --> 00:00:27.766
instead of coming to the farm. It had been fun, but it had delayed the start

6
00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:34.260
of Howler's training. Jackie opened the kennel door, and the little dog burst out. He

7
00:00:34.261 --> 00:00:44.437
moved at a quick trot, nose to the ground. Howler was a hound, and hounds

8
00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:51.843
depended on their noses for tracking. The beagle twisted and turned as he ran, making

9
00:00:51.844 --> 00:01:06.509
it hard to judge his gait. She'd have to figure that out later. While the

10
00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:10.009
beagle ran off some energy, Jackie went to visit the litter of puppies. Grandma had

11
00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:16.232
let Shadow out of the pen. The puppy was toddling after her. "You're already training

