00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:39.972
Shadow snuffled along the ground for more. "Puppies are so cute!" "You'll have lots of opportunity

15
00:01:39.973 --> 00:01:48.959
to play with this one later," Grandma said. Jackie took the hint—she needed to focus

16
00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:56.291
on Howler today. "Howler, come!" Jackie called. He came running, and she snapped on a

17
00:01:56.292 --> 00:02:02.115
leash. Then she ran a grooming glove over him, cleaning the dust from his black,

18
00:02:02.116 --> 00:02:08.208
tan, and white coat. She liked the way his tail had a white feathery banner

19
00:02:08.209 --> 00:02:13.435
at the tip like a tiny flag. Howler stood still for the grooming, but he

20
00:02:13.436 --> 00:02:20.094
definitely didn't like it as much as Poke did. His black nose quivered—he was eager

21
00:02:20.095 --> 00:02:30.677
to get moving again. A few minutes later, Jackie took him into the training ring

22
00:02:30.678 --> 00:02:40.154
and lifted him onto a platform. Howler was a small beagle, so judges might choose

23
00:02:40.155 --> 00:02:45.335
to have him stacked on a table rather than on the ground. Jackie had to be

24
